B.aat=new A.cS("Home","At the top is You: a chat with yourself, kept in your own Google Drive. Below it are your groups, and All files, which lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.aae=new A.cS("Send","Tap Send at the bottom of Home. Pick a file or write a note, pick where it goes, then pick how it opens: One open, Watermarked or Traceable copies.",!1)
B.aa_=new A.cS("What needs an account","Nothing, to send a note or file that opens once, or to open a link or code. Your own chat and groups need you to sign in with Google.",!1)
B.a9V=new A.cS("Everything else","Your picture at the top opens your account. Settings has Activity, notifications and Help.",!1)
